:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"    红平边炮欲出左直车，实战证明难以如愿，不如改走炮八进二，对局势有利。","text":"    红平边炮欲出左直车，实战证明难以如愿，不如改走炮八进二，对局势有利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"    黑炮压马攻守兼备，且使敌计划落空，是步意味深长的佳着，走来十分机敏。","text":"    黑炮压马攻守兼备，且使敌计划落空，是步意味深长的佳着，走来十分机敏。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"    黑方联车，着法紧凑，准备兑红左车，然后集中力量由右翼制造攻势，此着颇具战略意义。","text":"    黑方联车，着法紧凑，准备兑红左车，然后集中力量由右翼制造攻势，此着颇具战略意义。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"    红方平炮方向不对，应炮五平四，阵形较为协调稳固。黑及时兑车好棋，由此展开攻势，打击红空虚的左翼。","text":"    红方平炮方向不对，应炮五平四，阵形较为协调稳固。黑及时兑车好棋，由此展开攻势，打击红空虚的左翼。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"    经上一段，黑方着法紧凑，攻势逐渐展开，现平车塞相眼，将予红方致命的打击。","text":"    经上一段，黑方着法紧凑，攻势逐渐展开，现平车塞相眼，将予红方致命的打击。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"    黑胜。||    ||","text":"    黑胜。\n    \n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["067宁夏赵丰 先负 河北李来群"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D12 顺炮直车对缓开车"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":14,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646